{"generatedFrom":"design/quiz-ideas/fathers/ (quiz.json from model.mjs, people.json, preview/img/credits.json)","statements":[{"id":"laugh","text":"A good hearty laugh is good for the soul.","topic":"laughter","slug":"laughter"},{"id":"quiet","text":"Most of the time, it's better to say less.","topic":"saying less","slug":"silence"},{"id":"learning","text":"Wisdom is worth learning from anyone, even people who don't share your faith.","topic":"learning from outsiders","slug":"learning-from-outsiders"},{"id":"anger","text":"Anger at real wrongdoing can be a good thing.","topic":"anger","slug":"anger"},{"id":"alone","text":"If you had to choose, you'd grow closer to God alone in quiet than among other people.","topic":"solitude","slug":"solitude"},{"id":"rich","text":"There's nothing wrong with being rich, as long as you use it well.","topic":"being rich","slug":"being-rich"},{"id":"tell","text":"If someone you know is doing wrong, it's your job to tell them.","topic":"speaking up","slug":"confronting-wrong"},{"id":"tears","text":"Even if you believe you'll see them again, it's right to weep openly for someone you've lost.","topic":"grief","slug":"grief"},{"id":"lie","text":"Lying can be the right thing to do if it protects someone.","topic":"lying","slug":"lying"},{"id":"surplus","text":"Giving to the poor isn't generosity. It's paying back what's already theirs.","topic":"the poor","slug":"the-poor"},{"id":"nature","text":"Nature can teach you as much about God as the Bible can.","topic":"nature","slug":"nature"},{"id":"calm","text":"The best way to live is free of strong emotions, with only a steady peace inside.","topic":"strong feelings","slug":"strong-feelings"},{"id":"body","text":"Your body is a friend to look after, not an enemy to fight.","topic":"the body","slug":"the-body"},{"id":"dreams","text":"God still speaks to people through dreams.","topic":"dreams","slug":"dreams"},{"id":"miracles","text":"Miracles still happen today, just as they did in the Bible.","topic":"miracles","slug":"miracles"},{"id":"mystery","text":"Some questions about God are better left alone.","topic":"questions about God","slug":"questioning-god"},{"id":"deeper","text":"In many Bible stories, the deeper meaning matters more than the history.","topic":"the Bible's stories","slug":"reading-the-bible"},{"id":"calling","text":"If you believe God is calling you, follow, even if your family begs you not to.","topic":"family and calling","slug":"family-and-calling"},{"id":"pure","text":"A church should keep out people who openly live in serious wrongdoing.","topic":"who belongs in church","slug":"church-discipline"},{"id":"war","text":"A Christian can fight in a just war with a clear conscience.","topic":"war","slug":"war"},{"id":"rulers","text":"Governments should use their laws to promote the Christian faith.","topic":"faith and government","slug":"faith-and-government"},{"id":"effort","text":"Becoming a better person is mostly down to your own effort.","topic":"effort and grace","slug":"grace-and-effort"},{"id":"all","text":"In the end, God will save everyone.","topic":"whether all are saved","slug":"universal-salvation"}],"centre":{"laugh":[1.7,-0.82],"quiet":[0.7,1.18],"learning":[1.5,0.24],"anger":[1.3,0.44],"alone":[-0.2,0.08],"rich":[0.9,0.78],"tell":[0.4,1.31],"tears":[1.9,-0.33],"lie":[0.5,-0.29],"surplus":[0.3,1.56],"nature":[0.4,0.33],"calm":[-0.9,0.4],"body":[1.2,0.18],"dreams":[0.4,1.44],"miracles":[0.8,1.33],"mystery":[0.5,-0.07],"deeper":[0.1,0.56],"calling":[1.1,1.46],"pure":[-0.5,0.91],"war":[0.4,-0.36],"rulers":[-0.7,0.8],"effort":[-0.6,-0.42],"all":[-0.4,-0.75]},"people":{"augustine":{"slug":"augustine-of-hippo","name":"Augustine of Hippo","short":"Augustine","she":false,"dates":"354 to 430","who":"Bishop of Hippo. His Confessions is the first great life story told from the inside.","cells":{"laugh":{"v":1,"hide":true},"quiet":{"v":-1,"len":149},"learning":{"v":2,"len":259},"anger":{"v":2,"len":193},"rich":{"v":2,"len":105},"tell"